      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `3c2444bbdb48fcf4a7d8aae303bfa46b1fd556e9d73c46f1e3a5e3226139904d--45100do008_2010.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | aee9ebaac7d72a2358e4d864f1f5675a7e7358e74e4b62cb6eee5aaeece164a0 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 0e544bea7bf572222ec0e0f98d7caa67e882704097c8cb696b1ad7c60fc1c18f | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 7fb617c0df8d89c169c73a67d9919ef8d063260d3d0dea72a90bfcbb3dba89c6 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 54bbbd1696a402a914defaadc0a7541f83aa4d9f3daa22ac6814643517a018e9 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 014f9364283963e2de28e52fbffd31c3b3e717bcbb001b2250c0f38cf5a9a26c | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | ee3a6f1fe0c46da5d6e198d2f4d4dd8d70ab7f1c0af9657581064b84fdbd3d6c | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | f83a2d47eb70ce97a9336938757c61ce133426394128329d0ebd76de072f8a2d | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | ec63c90d01191818179998cc5aac23613920ee827d2f0268d0658647b1b0cbcf | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
